# Text-to-speech: synthesizes text into a wav file in the audio cache.

# Goal
string text                     # text to speak, must not be empty or whitespace only
---
# Result
bool success
string message                  # status or error description
string file_path                # absolute path of the created wav file, pass it on to AudioPlayer
float32 duration                # length of the created audio in seconds
---
# No Feedback